subtitle: The majority of our party is strongly against this course of action

Our left and labor factions are united in an uproar against this and many have broken with the party to denounce this initiative. Meanwhile, our center and right are uneasy over our tacit approval of Hugenberg's actions As a 'natural governing party', our inaction on such an issue is met with confusion from outside observers
